The [[Burning Torch]] is a [[weapon]] obtained by "lighting" the [[Torch]] using any [[fire]] item. Its stats are identical to the [[Torch]], other than that it gives 2 {{icon/heat}} at the start of battle and has a slightly higher chance of gaining damage on hit, making it strictly better.
